to those with flesh. This weapon does 6d8 bleeding damage to those that are vulnerable to it.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Bane_(enchantment)\" title=\"Bane (enchantment)\">Humanoid Bane 6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Bane_(enchantment)\" title=\"Bane (enchantment)\">Humanoid Bane 6</a>:</b> This weapon is attuned specifically to those that walk among us, dealing an additional 6d10 bane damage vs. Humanoids.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Feeding\" title=\"Feeding\">Feeding&#32;30</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Feeding\" title=\"Feeding\">Feeding&#32;30</a>:</b> On <a href=\"/page/Vorpal_Strike\" title=\"Vorpal Strike\">Vorpal Hit</a>: Your target incurs one <a href=\"/page/Negative_Level\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Negative Level\">Negative Level</a>, and you gain +30 <a href=\"/page/Temporary_hit_point\" title=\"Temporary hit point\">temporary hit points</a>. (These Temporary Hit Points last for one minute, or until used to negate incoming damage.)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Maiming\" title=\"Maiming\">Maiming 6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><sp